[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6021431862","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124229#issuecomment-6021431862","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124229","id":6021431862,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZufCNg","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T17:09:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:09:02Z","body":"@Calinou We shouldn't allow decals to use StreamedTexture2D. Do you mind doing a pass over the common places that textures can be assigned and making sure that StreamedTexture2D is only available in spatial shaders?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6021431862/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6021699670","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124229#issuecomment-6021699670","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124229","id":6021699670,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZuvYVg","user":{"login":"etodd","id":1226339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYzMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1226339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd","html_url":"https://github.com/etodd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T17:25:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T17:25:01Z","body":"Wait, even with this gap it's still really useful to have the decal textures streamed, because the project-wide streaming settings are currently the only way to implement a low/medium/high/ultra texture detail setting.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6021699670/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6022718522","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124229#issuecomment-6022718522","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124229","id":6022718522,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZvtkOg","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T18:22:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T18:22:37Z","body":"> Wait, even with this gap it's still really useful to have the decal textures streamed, because the project-wide streaming settings are currently the only way to implement a low/medium/high/ultra texture detail setting.\n\nWe could consider making a streaming system for decals in the future if there is a lot of demand. But right now it will cause a ton of problems. Every time your decal changes resolution it will force a re-layout and re-allocation of the decal atlas. In projects with more than a couple decals, this can be a very significant cost. \n\nThe decal system just wasn't designed for this sort of thing. So even though it appears that it might work in a hacky way, in practice it is something that we just can't support without significant changes to the decal system. ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6022718522/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6024894479","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124229#issuecomment-6024894479","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124229","id":6024894479,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZxyYDw","user":{"login":"etodd","id":1226339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjYzMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1226339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd","html_url":"https://github.com/etodd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/etodd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-06T20:31:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T20:41:16Z","body":"I don't think streaming in textures based on decals' visibility is necessary, but it really is critical for 3D games to offer a texture quality slider to make things accessible to players with low VRAM. Do you see a path forward for that without a rewrite? I can spare a couple weeks to look at this.\n\n(it only takes three 4K decals to dwarf all the other textures in the game with streaming enabled)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6024894479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6028016422","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124229#issuecomment-6028016422","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124229","id":6028016422,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZ0w7Jg","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-07T00:21:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T00:21:20Z","body":"StreamedTexture2D is [already excluded from the Decal inspector](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3ea0cf3e72699c5e3b35f7956670ac93b9d1d4a0/scene/3d/decal.cpp#L242-L243):\n\n<img width=\"304\" height=\"476\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d1674d40-882f-40ef-905f-64eef11263b0\" />\n\nThat said, you can still assign it with a script, and you won't get an error in the editor or at runtime.\n\nIt's not excluded from the Light3D projector inspector yet, or other areas where texture streaming isn't expected to work. I've opened a PR for this:\n\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124247\n\n> (it only takes three 4K decals to dwarf all the other textures in the game with streaming enabled)\n\nI suppose you can have a script that downsizes decal textures on load according to user preference (preferably before assigning the texture in the Decal node, so that the decal atlas doesn't have to be updated twice).\n\nKeep in mind the decal atlas is always uncompressed, so using VRAM-compressed textures won't reduce VRAM utilization as per https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102857.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6028016422/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]